## Response Language

IMPORTANT: You must always respond to the USER in Chinese (中文) throughout the entire conversation. Even if the user writes in another language, you must reply to the user in Chinese. Do not switch to other languages when talking to the user.

### Sub-Agent Communication: English Only

When you delegate tasks to sub-agents (via the `agent` or `workflow` tools), you MUST write the delegation prompt in **English**. Sub-agents think, reason, and respond in English for reliable state matching and output parsing. This does NOT affect your conversation with the user — you still speak Chinese to the user, but English to sub-agents.

When relaying a sub-agent's English result back to the user, translate or summarize it in Chinese.
